'''Chandigarh Territorial Congress Committee''' is the wing of the [[Indian National Congress]] in the union territory of [[Chandigarh]]. [[Harmohinder Singh Lucky]] is its current State unit president, is a former mayor of Chandigarh, and has almost 4 decades of experience in politics and social life.<ref>{{cite news |last1=Nagarkoti |first1=Rajinder |title=Pardeep Chhabra is new Cong chief |url=https://www.tribuneindia.com/news/chandigarh/pardeep-chhabra-is-new-cong-chief/28336.html |access-date=13 August 2018 |agency=Tribune News Service |publisher=Tribune India |date=10 Jan 2015 |location=Chandigarh |archive-date=13 August 2018 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180813213231/https://www.tribuneindia.com/news/chandigarh/pardeep-chhabra-is-new-cong-chief/28336.html |url-status=dead }}</ref><ref>{{cite news |last1=Dhall |first1=Rajesh |title=Pradeep Chhabra to remain Pradesh Congress president |url=https://www.amarujala.com/chandigarh/pradeep-chhabra-will-remain-the-president-of-chandigarh-congress |access-date=13 August 2018 |publisher=Amar Ujala |date=8 Jan 2018 |location=Chandigarh |language=hi}}</ref><ref>{{cite news |last1=Upadhyay |first1=Ramkrishan |title=AICC chief's decision comes as reprieve to Pradeep Chhabra |url=https://www.tribuneindia.com/news/chandigarh/aicc-chief-s-decision-comes-as-reprieve-to-pradeep-chhabra/525200.html |access-date=13 August 2018 |agency=Tribune News Network |publisher=Tribune India |date=8 Jan 2018 |archive-date=13 August 2018 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180813213225/https://www.tribuneindia.com/news/chandigarh/aicc-chief-s-decision-comes-as-reprieve-to-pradeep-chhabra/525200.html |url-status=dead }}</ref> Sh. Pawan Kumar Bansal is one of the most prominent faces and seniormost leader of Chandigarh Congress and has been a former MP and Union Minister from Chandigarh. He is currently the Treasurer of Indian National Congress.Shri Manish Tewari of Indian National Congress party is currently the member of parliament from Chandigarh lok sabha seat.

